<p class="lead">There is less than 24 hours left to complete our member survey. It closes at <strong>midnight tonight, 23 September</strong>, before we meet Jaguar Land Rover tomorrow.</p>

<p>As of 23 September, <strong>738 members have submitted their answers</strong>. Thank you to everyone who has taken part. If you have not responded, please add your voice while there is still time.</p>

