<h2>What we need to hear</h2>
<p>You can support a full HV battery replacement, a fair buy-back, neither route, fair compensation, and the repair of additional faults. Select every outcome you would accept and, if you wish, mark your preferred option.</p>
<p>Results stay hidden until you submit, so your response is your own. You can return and change it while the survey remains open.</p>

<h2>Owners have built a strong evidence base</h2>
<p>Since the group officially launched on <strong>17 July 2026</strong>, 1,550 owners have joined. Members have recorded 786 cars, 144 battery-health readings and 203 service and fault records. These histories help show the practical effect of recalls, battery faults, repeated repairs and delays.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn--secondary survey-reminder-pill" href="/member/dashboard/">Add my vehicle history</a></p>

